{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "FinFlow — Commerce (marketplace)",
    "description": "## Before you start\n\n1. Import **FinFlow Local** environment (`postman/FinFlow-Local.postman_environment.json` at repo root) or set collection variables.\n2. **Identity:** register → verify → login → (merchant) create org → login again → copy `accessToken`.\n3. **Wallet** (only if `payment.provider=wallet`): create wallet + deposit.\n\n## Roles\n\n| Who | Prefix | Sends seller/org id? |\n|-----|--------|----------------------|\n| **Customer** | `/api/v1/customer/...` | **No** — use `productId` only; seller is internal |\n| **Merchant** | `/api/v1/merchant/...` | **No** — seller from JWT `orgIds` |\n\n## Recommended order\n\n**Merchant setup:** `06 Merchant` → category → product → (optional) coupon  \n**Shop:** `02 Browse` → `03 Cart` → checkout → `04 Orders`  \n**Fulfil & returns:** `07 Merchant orders` → `05` / `08` returns\n\n## Checkout\n\n`POST .../carts/checkout` returns `{ \"orders\": [ ... ] }` — **one order per seller** in the cart.  \nUse a **new** `Idempotency-Key` per checkout attempt.\n\nBase URL: `{{commerceBaseUrl}}` (default `http://localhost:18083`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "commerceBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:18083" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "returnId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "couponCode", "value": "SAVE10" },
    { "key": "orderKey", "value": "order-demo-001" },
    { "key": "checkoutKey", "value": "checkout-demo-001" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Health",
      "description": "Actuator is public. Dependency check needs Bearer + `commerce:read`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Actuator health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/actuator/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Dependency checks",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/health/dependencies"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 Customer — Browse",
      "description": "Global marketplace catalogue. No org/seller id in requests.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/categories"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/products/search?q=&categoryId={{categoryId}}&page=0&size=20",
              "host": ["{{commerceBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "customer", "products", "search"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "q", "value": "" },
                { "key": "categoryId", "value": "{{categoryId}}" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "size", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get product by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/products/{{productId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 Customer — Cart & checkout",
      "description": "Add by productId only. Checkout creates one order per seller in the cart.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/carts"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add item",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": {{productId}},\n  \"quantity\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/carts/items"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update item quantity",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/carts/items/{{productId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Checkout (all sellers in cart)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (body.orders && body.orders.length > 0 && body.orders[0].orderId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', String(body.orders[0].orderId));",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{checkoutKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"shippingAddress\": {\n    \"line1\": \"10 FinFlow Street\",\n    \"line2\": \"Suite 2\",\n    \"city\": \"London\",\n    \"state\": \"ENG\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"EC1A1BB\",\n    \"country\": \"GB\"\n  },\n  \"couponCode\": \"{{couponCode}}\",\n  \"paymentOutcome\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/carts/checkout"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove item",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/carts/items/{{productId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Clear cart",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/carts"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 Customer — Orders",
      "description": "Direct place-order (alternative to cart) or manage existing orders.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create order (direct, no cart)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (b.orderId) pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', String(b.orderId));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{orderKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"productId\": {{productId}}, \"quantity\": 1 }\n  ],\n  \"shippingAddress\": {\n    \"line1\": \"10 FinFlow Street\",\n    \"line2\": null,\n    \"city\": \"London\",\n    \"state\": \"ENG\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"EC1A1BB\",\n    \"country\": \"GB\"\n  },\n  \"couponCode\": null,\n  \"paymentOutcome\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/orders"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List my orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/orders"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/orders/{{orderId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pay order (retry)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/pay"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel order",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 Customer — Returns",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Request return",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (b.returnId) pm.collectionVariables.set('returnId', String(b.returnId));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Damaged on arrival\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/returns"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List returns for order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/returns"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 Merchant — Catalogue",
      "description": "Use merchant token (org in JWT). Bodies do **not** include organisationId.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create category",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (b.categoryId) pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', String(b.categoryId));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Electronics\",\n  \"slug\": \"electronics\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/categories"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create product",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (b.productId) pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', String(b.productId));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Demo Laptop\",\n  \"unitPrice\": \"999.00\",\n  \"availableQuantity\": 25,\n  \"categoryId\": {{categoryId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/products"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update product (PATCH)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"unitPrice\": \"949.00\",\n  \"availableQuantity\": 20\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/products/{{productId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 Merchant — Coupons",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create coupon",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{couponCode}}\",\n  \"percentOff\": \"10.00\",\n  \"expiresAt\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/coupons"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 Merchant — Orders & fulfilment",
      "description": "Seller resolved from JWT — no organisationId query param.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List shop orders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/orders?mineOnly=false",
              "host": ["{{commerceBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "merchant", "orders"],
              "query": [{ "key": "mineOnly", "value": "false" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List shop orders (mine only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/orders?mineOnly=true",
              "host": ["{{commerceBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "merchant", "orders"],
              "query": [{ "key": "mineOnly", "value": "true" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get order",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/orders/{{orderId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Start fulfilment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/orders/{{orderId}}/fulfilment/start"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete fulfilment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/orders/{{orderId}}/fulfilment/complete"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "09 Merchant — Returns",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Approve return",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/returns/{{returnId}}/approve"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject return",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/returns/{{returnId}}/reject"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Complete return (refund)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{commerceBaseUrl}}/api/v1/merchant/returns/{{returnId}}/complete"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
